0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(distinct contrastive lexical tones: Tone 1 \(High Level, 55\), Tone 2 \(Mid) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(Level, 33\), and Tone 3 \(Low Falling, 21\). We examine tone perturbation) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
